# Impeccable design hook — config.json is shared and committed; the rest is local state.
# The hook resolves its project root from the working directory, so a config exists
# both at the repo root and under frontend/; the ** keeps the cache ignored at either.
**/.impeccable/hook.cache.json
**/.impeccable/config.local.json
.gstack/
